{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13509","headline":"故太常卿赠礼部尚书李公及夫人挽歌二首 一 · 蒋涣","name":"故太常卿赠礼部尚书李公及夫人挽歌二首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"白简尝持宪，黄图复尹京。\n能标百郡则，威肃一朝清。\n典秩崇三礼，临戍振五兵。\n更闻传世业，才子有高名。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"蒋涣","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_13509.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13509","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}